 explore the dangerous pit came to be known as \\\"Cave Raiders.\\\"\\n\\nIn Oosu, the town at the edge of the Abyss, there lives a little orphan named Rico, who dreams of becoming as great a cave raider as her mother was and solving the great mystery of the pit. One day exploring the murky depths she stumbles upon a little boy, who turns out to be a robot...\",\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"MuboGrmPDIg\",\"name\":\"Trailer\"}],\"relations\":[],\"characters\":[{\"name\":\"Regu\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/62198/image/tiny-fa70c3e767a2388ef7a9ab8c4405019a.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Mariya Ise\"},{\"name\":\"Riko\",\"role\":\"MAIN\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/66177/image/tiny-977be44a9fc6b162d121f406945b5f3f.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Miyu Tomita\"},{\"name\":\"Ouzen\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/62200/image/tiny-cb26679bc8d47b3600a2026e79d1bc87.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Sayaka Ohara\"},{\"name\":\"Bondrewd\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/95083/image/tiny-256b1e29cd6ddec0b7e27c55433109fd.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Toshiyuki Morikawa\"},{\"name\":\"Habolg\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/97445/image/tiny-4cb18cc7ffcdda553cb010d533ceaef6.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Tetsu Inada\"},{\"name\":\"Inchou\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/97320/image/tiny-eabd1d038c40a5744edab7fc48a7afdf.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Yoko Soumi\"},{\"name\":\"Jiruo\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/96449/image/tiny-5a31d5842ab39f96f860fce3da63bea1.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Taishi Murata\"},{\"name\":\"Kiwi\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/96448/image/tiny-16cea1050c8b6ab8afcef43a88c580dd.jpeg\",\"voiceActor\":\"Manami Hanawa\"},{\"name\":\"Laffi\",\"role\":\"SUPPORTING\",\"image\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/character/98787/image/tiny-dd